  Quintanilla's Civil Procedure Class
DESCRIPTION:Join ILAP\, Professor Quintanilla\, and the Office for Commun
 ity\, Impact\, and Engagement for a "Just Mercy" Movie Night! Hear studen
 t testimonials about how Bryan Stevenson's novel impacted their path to b
 ecoming an attorney and listen to Professor Quintanilla discuss why this 
 book is a pivotal teaching tool during his first-year Civil Procedure Cou
 rse prior to enjoying the film. Food will be provided to all attendees. P
 lease RSVP by 6PM on November 20th so we are aware of dietary restriction
 s.
